{"id":"ced779f9ea9b74df","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-relative-completeness.md","title":"Relative Arithmetical Complexity and Reductions","display":"df-relative-completeness — Relative Arithmetical Complexity and Reductions","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-relative-completeness","aliases":["89-df-relative-completeness"],"display":"df-relative-completeness — Relative Arithmetical Complexity and Reductions","depends_on":[],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-relative-completeness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-relative-completeness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-relative-completeness — Relative Arithmetical Complexity and Reductions"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(X,A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。可计算函数/关系采用通常有限程序或图灵机定义。</li>\n<li>“在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 中可计算”允许程序查询成员关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in X\">\\(t\\in X\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rec}^X_k\">\\(\\mathsf{Rec}^X_k\\)</span> 为可用此 oracle 判定的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 元关系集合。</li>\n<li>下列递归同时用于所有有限元数，投影变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span> 取自然数。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}relative\\text{-}completeness}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\Sigma^0_0(X)&amp;=\\Pi^0_0(X)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Rec}^X,\\\\\nR\\in\\Sigma^0_{n+1}(X)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists P\\in\\Pi^0_n(X)\\ \\forall\\bar x\\\n(R(\\bar x)\\leftrightarrow\\exists y\\,P(\\bar x,y)),\\\\\nR\\in\\Pi^0_{n+1}(X)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists P\\in\\Sigma^0_n(X)\\ \\forall\\bar x\\\n(R(\\bar x)\\leftrightarrow\\forall y\\,P(\\bar x,y)),\\\\\nA\\le_m B&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\\n(f\\text{ total computable}\\land\\forall t(t\\in A\\leftrightarrow f(t)\\in B)),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Complete}_m(B,\\mathcal C)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\nB\\in\\mathcal C\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal C\\ (A\\le_m B).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}relative\\text{-}completeness}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\Sigma^0_0(X)&amp;=\\Pi^0_0(X)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Rec}^X,\\\\\nR\\in\\Sigma^0_{n+1}(X)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists P\\in\\Pi^0_n(X)\\ \\forall\\bar x\\\n(R(\\bar x)\\leftrightarrow\\exists y\\,P(\\bar x,y)),\\\\\nR\\in\\Pi^0_{n+1}(X)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists P\\in\\Sigma^0_n(X)\\ \\forall\\bar x\\\n(R(\\bar x)\\leftrightarrow\\forall y\\,P(\\bar x,y)),\\\\\nA\\le_m B&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\\n(f\\text{ total computable}\\land\\forall t(t\\in A\\leftrightarrow f(t)\\in B)),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Complete}_m(B,\\mathcal C)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\nB\\in\\mathcal C\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal C\\ (A\\le_m B).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 17 章，印刷页 220–225；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n这里分清“oracle 用于定义类”与“归约函数使用 oracle”：本条的多一归约函数为普通总可计算函数，后续相对真值定理沿用原书实际给出的这种有效编码归约。递归可枚举集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^0_1(\\varnothing)\">\\(\\Sigma^0_1(\\varnothing)\\)</span>；默认无 oracle 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^0_n,\\Pi^0_n\">\\(\\Sigma^0_n,\\Pi^0_n\\)</span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X=\\varnothing\">\\(X=\\varnothing\\)</span>。本条登记本书所需接口，不在此重造图灵机编码的基础理论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"X,A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"t\\in X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Rec}^X_k","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"y","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}relative\\text{-}completeness}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\Sigma^0_0(X)&=\\Pi^0_0(X)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Rec}^X,\\\\\nR\\in\\Sigma^0_{n+1}(X)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists P\\in\\Pi^0_n(X)\\ \\forall\\bar x\\\n(R(\\bar x)\\leftrightarrow\\exists y\\,P(\\bar x,y)),\\\\\nR\\in\\Pi^0_{n+1}(X)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists P\\in\\Sigma^0_n(X)\\ \\forall\\bar x\\\n(R(\\bar x)\\leftrightarrow\\forall y\\,P(\\bar x,y)),\\\\\nA\\le_m B&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\\n(f\\text{ total computable}\\land\\forall t(t\\in A\\leftrightarrow f(t)\\in B)),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Complete}_m(B,\\mathcal C)&\\Longleftrightarrow\nB\\in\\mathcal C\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal C\\ (A\\le_m B).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\Sigma^0_1(\\varnothing)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma^0_n,\\Pi^0_n","display":false},{"tex":"X=\\varnothing","display":false}],"bytes":1985,"backlinks":[{"id":"5195478e7a49fc18","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"73653f2b36e4ca9d","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4e0f03a34c592870","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-73","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-relative-completeness]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":